    "mission_rules": [
      "Use cold gas for simple, safe, low-delta-v maneuvering and 6DOF control.",
      "Use green chemical propulsion when rapid maneuver, collision avoidance, or high thrust is required.",
      "Use FEEP/electrospray or metal plasma thrusters for fine impulse, station keeping, and precision maneuvers.",
      "Use ion or Hall propulsion for high delta-v and orbit raising when EPS power is sufficient.",
      "Propellant-management components are support components; complete propulsion systems already include many of these functions."
    ]
